{
 "encounter_id": "00910",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I'm still getting this pressure in my face. The spray you gave me isn't doing much."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks for coming back. Where do you feel the pressure?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Around my cheeks and across my forehead. It's worse when I bend over."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how long has it been going on now?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nearly three weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is there discharge from the nose, and what colour?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thick and yellowish, mostly in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, or swelling around the eyes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever. And my eyes look normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's go through what you're taking. Which spray is it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The steroid nasal spray, fluticasone, two sprays in each nostril, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you using it every day?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Most days. I forget some mornings, to be honest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 1 gram, when the face is sore. And a saline rinse, twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good, the rinse helps. Do you have any other conditions, like hay fever or asthma?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hay fever, every summer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse, blood pressure and temperature. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 124 over 80, temperature 36.8, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All normal. I'd like to look in your nose and press over the sinuses. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on.",
   "pause": 14.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I would say this is sinusitis, probably still viral, though the thick discharge makes me think of a bacterial cause."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need antibiotics? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not yet. Three weeks is long enough that I'd consider it, but let's do the basics properly first. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What are the basics? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Use the spray every single day, keep up the saline rinse, and take steam inhalations at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it hasn't improved in a week, or you get a fever or swelling around the eyes, I'll prescribe an antibiotic."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That sounds fair. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Come back and see me then, and we'll decide together. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
